<view class="page">
 <view class="eyebrow">生活的考古 / 001</view><view class="title">从一盏茶，读懂古人的日常。</view><text class="sub">20件茶器 · 3家收藏机构 · 5篇背景资料</text>
 <view class="tabs"><button bindtap="tab" data-tab="objects">茶器档案</button><button bindtap="tab" data-tab="reading">主题阅读</button><button bindtap="compare">双件对看 {{selected.length}}/2</button></view>
 <block wx:if="{{detail}}"><button class="link" bindtap="back">← 返回档案</button><image wx:if="{{detail.image}}" src="{{detail.image}}" mode="aspectFit" class="hero"/><view class="no-photo" wx:else>原图请到馆方页面查看</view><view class="name">{{detail.title}}</view><text class="sub">{{detail.institution}} · {{detail.period}}</text><text class="body">{{detail.summary}}</text><text class="tiny">{{detail.imageRights}} 中文名称可能为辅助译名。</text><view class="field" wx:for="{{fields}}" wx:key="label"><text class="label">{{item.label}}</text><view><text>{{item.value}}</text><button class="link" wx:if="{{item.sourceId}}" data-id="{{item.sourceId}}" bindtap="copySource">复制出处 ↗</button></view></view><view wx:if="{{detail.dateViews.length}}" class="notice"><view>保留不同表述，不擅自合并断代</view><text class="body" wx:for="{{detail.dateViews}}" wx:key="label">{{item.label}}：{{item.value}}</text></view><view class="notice"><view>换个角度，亲近器物。</view><text class="tiny">程序生成的3D器型示意，非文物扫描或精确复原。釉色、纹饰、柄嘴与壁厚未测绘，不用于鉴定或复刻。</text><button class="outline" bindtap="showViewer">{{show3d?'收起3D示意':'转一转3D器型示意 ↗'}}</button><view wx:if="{{show3d}}"><canvas wx:if="{{!viewerError}}" type="webgl" id="native-object-canvas" class="native-viewer" bindtouchstart="viewerStart" catchtouchmove="viewerMove" bindtouchend="viewerEnd" bindtouchcancel="viewerEnd"/><view wx:if="{{viewerError}}" class="body">当前环境不支持3D，请继续查看馆方原图与档案。</view><view class="viewer-controls"><button data-action="left" bindtap="viewerControl">↶</button><button data-action="right" bindtap="viewerControl">↷</button><button data-action="in" bindtap="viewerControl">＋</button><button data-action="out" bindtap="viewerControl">−</button><button data-action="reset" bindtap="viewerControl">复位</button></view></view></view><button class="outline" data-id="{{detail.id}}" bindtap="pick">选择 / 移出对看</button><button class="link" data-id="{{detail.sourceIds[0]}}" bindtap="copySource">复制馆方原文链接与使用条件 ↗</button></block>
 <block wx:elif="{{tab==='objects'}}"><input value="{{query}}" bindinput="search" placeholder="搜索兔毫、馆名、年代或编号"/><text class="tiny">找到 {{items.length}} 件茶器</text><view class="cards"><view class="card" wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="id"><view data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="open"><image wx:if="{{item.image}}" src="{{item.image}}" mode="aspectFit"/><view wx:else class="placeholder">藏品档案 · {{item.objectType}}</view><text class="tiny">{{item.institution}} · {{item.period}}</text><view class="name">{{item.title}}</view><text class="body">{{item.summary}}</text><text class="tiny">{{item.number}}</text></view><button class="link" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="pick">{{item.picked?'✓ 已选':'＋ 对看'}}</button></view></view><view wx:if="{{!items.length}}" class="notice">当前资料没有匹配条目，可以换一个关键词。</view></block>
 <block wx:elif="{{tab==='reading'}}"><view class="reading" wx:for="{{steps}}" wx:key="title"><view class="name">{{item.title}}</view><text class="body">{{item.text}}</text></view><view class="reading" wx:for="{{documents}}" wx:key="id"><text class="tiny">{{item.institution}} · {{item.kind}}</text><view class="name">{{item.title}}</view><text class="body">{{item.summary}}</text><text class="body" wx:for="{{item.claims}}" wx:for-item="claim" wx:key="text">· {{claim.text}}</text><button class="link" data-id="{{item.sourceIds[0]}}" bindtap="copySource">复制资料出处 ↗</button></view></block>
 <block wx:elif="{{tab==='compare'}}"><view class="compare-head"><view wx:for="{{compare}}" wx:key="id"><view class="name">{{item.title}}</view><text class="tiny">{{item.institution}}</text><button class="link" data-id="{{item.sourceIds[0]}}" bindtap="copySource">复制出处 ↗</button></view></view><view class="comparison" wx:for="{{rows}}" wx:key="label"><view class="label">{{item.label}}</view><view><text>{{item.left}}</text><text>{{item.right}}</text></view></view><view class="notice">缺失保持缺失；并置不证明器物有直接历史联系。</view></block>
 <view class="notice"><view>让每一个解释，留有出处。</view><text class="body">{{scope}}</text><text class="tiny">原生工程本页支持离线阅读与对比。带引用的 AI 问答请在网页版本体验。</text><button class="outline" bindtap="webAssistant">复制网页版知识助手链接 ↗</button></view>
</view>
